          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```txt\n？ Figure it Out\n1. Find the values of the following expressions by writing the\nterms in each case.\n(a) 28 – 7 + 8\n(b)39 – 2 × 6 + 11\n(c) 40 – 10 + 10 + 10\n(d) 48 – 10 × 2 + 16 ÷ 2\n(e) 6 × 3 – 4 × 8 × 5\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
